WEBVTT

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:06.060
Candy...!

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:06.350
Candy!

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:06.770
Candy...

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:07.480
Candy!

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.570
Leave me alone-kuru...

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:13.420
I'm nice and comfy here-kuru...

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.760
Candy!

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:21.160
Kuru...

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:26.000
Kuru!

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:31.510
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:33.350
Smile Precure!

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:34.250
Let's go!

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:35.780
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:36.920
All together!

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:38.520
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.720
Jump to tomorrow!

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:43.390
Smile Precure!

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:48.230
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:53.670
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:58.870
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:04.810
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:09.750
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:09.720
So bright!

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:14.920
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:21.360
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:21.860
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:23.030
Let's go!

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:25.730
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:28.670
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:33.470
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:34.040
Girls! Let's go!

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:35.710
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:36.840
Everybody!

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:38.510
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:41.050
Fly to the future!

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:44.550
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:46.720
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:49.020
Smile Precure!

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:55.720
We have gathered an additional sixteen Décors...

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:57.390
Kuru.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:01.290
...so the Royal Queen of Märchenland should have revived...

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:02.720
Kuru.

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:05.330
...or at least that's what we thought, but...

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.070
...instead we get this...?

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:09.270
Kuru?

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:15.840
Kuru?

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:19.810
So, that's finally reared its ugly head, has it?

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:24.970
Don't be so foolish as to think I will let your resurrection go as planned, however.

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:26.290
Because it won't happen.

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:39.900
So, Candy, what is this thing?

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:41.870
It's this incredible item-kuru!

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:43.500
How exactly do we use it?

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.470
It's an incredible item, no doubt about it-kuru!

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:46.840
And what can it do?

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:49.310
Make no mistake, it's an incredible item-kuru!

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.680
So basically, ya don't actually know, right?

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:57.520
O-Of course I do-kuru! I know... I know...

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:02.220
...I know I'm hungry-kuru.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.160
I know!

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:05.890
Kuru?

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:07.190
Ta-da!

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:10.630
A cookie-kuru! Miyuki, let's go halves-kuru!

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:15.730
Yeah. Food always tastes better when you share it!

00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:16.340
But...

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:20.070
If the two of us eat it, what about everyone else?

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:22.410
So let's <i>all</i> share it, together!

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:25.870
Yeah, I'm kinda hungry too, now ya mention it!

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:28.810
Kuru...

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.650
Those are tiny pieces-kuru...

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.920
But sharing them will make them taste even better!

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.930
Thanks for the food!

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:06.620
You're right, Miyuki-kuru! Sharing made it yummier-kuru!

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:08.710
Yeah, this is dang good!

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:11.690
All the more for sharing in the moment together.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:17.330
Happiness is always better when it's shared! That's the secret to being ultra happy!

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:18.060
Kuru!

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.500
Miyuki!

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:25.640
Good tidings, my friends!

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.020
Pop!

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:29.410
I believe I know what that item of yours is-de gozaru!

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:31.240
Onii-chan!!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.080
Hey, Joker. Whatcha got there?

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.510
It's a present for you.

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:40.650
A present?

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:46.230
I've taken the usual red noses we use, and clouded them in darkness.

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:48.990
They are surpassed by nothing.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:56.050
With these black noses, you can say goodbye to those unwieldy Super Akanbes,

00:04:56.050 --> 00:05:03.980
and welcome the new Hyper Akanbes, that you can personally control to your every whim.

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:09.980
And fear not. The Precure's pesky Rainbow Burst won't even be able to scratch them.

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:16.610
Perhaps we might actually get some results out of you three now, hrm?

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:19.260
We've been doing just fine without them-oni!

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:21.730
Oh, have you now?

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:25.390
King Pierrot seems to not think so.

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:29.130
"I have no use for commanders that can't even defeat the Precure!" were his words.

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:30.620
No use?!

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:31.600
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:34.810
Well... I suppose King Pierrot intends to dispose of you.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:38.810
Does this give you the rough idea?

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:43.450
Wolfrun-san?

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:48.390
I take it you will defeat the Precure for me this time, yes?

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:51.790
Sure! Leave it to me!

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:58.160
I have ascertained...

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:02.800
...that this is the legendary Royal Clock-de gozaru!

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:06.140
Wait, what the heck?!

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:09.310
What I have concluded from my copious research,

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:15.450
is that the Royal Clock will enhance your already immense powers-de gozaru.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:17.650
Wow, that's amazing, Pop!

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:19.690
We can always count on you!

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:23.560
So, how is it a clock when it doesn't have hands?

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:25.790
How do you work it-kuru?

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:27.430
Just leave that to me-de gozaru.

00:06:27.430 --> 00:06:29.640
Hello! Is anyone in there?

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:32.080
It's morning-de gozaru! Wakey-wakey-de gozaru!

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:53.650
It's the Royal Queen-sama!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:59.630
Thank you all. It is only due to your diligent collection of the Décors...

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:04.060
...that I am able to communicate with you through the Royal Clock.

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:09.170
But if you are to unleash the true power contained within the Royal Clock,

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:13.100
then you, the Precure, as well as Candy, must unlock further power of your own.

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:15.710
It needs...

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:17.180
...our powers?

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:19.650
Yes.

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:21.980
Damn you, Joker...

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:25.050
Acting all tough because you're Pierrot's favorite!

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:27.890
We'll see who's laughing when I defeat the Precure!

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:31.690
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:34.330
...a Bad End!

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:38.060
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness!

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:50.880
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, King Pierrot!

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:56.670
Your Majesty?

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:01.300
It's a Bad End zone-de gozaru!

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:02.150
Come on!

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:04.650
I beg you...

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:10.800
The Royal Clock is incredible-kuru!

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:13.800
Stop right there!

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:17.370
There you are, Precure!

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:18.340
What is that?

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.970
A black nose! It's even better than the red ones!

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:25.390
Lemme show you something even stronger than a Super Akanbe!

00:08:25.390 --> 00:08:28.140
Come on out, Hyper Akanbe!

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:37.860
What the...?!

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:42.900
Hyper Akanbe!

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:46.930
He fused with the Akanbe?!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.530
Hurry up and transform-kuru!

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:55.060
Ready?

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:58.350
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:58.960
Go!

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:02.170
Go, go!

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:03.800
Let's go!

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:19.020
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.130
Cure Happy!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.760
Dazzling sun!

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:28.960
Hot-blooded power!

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:31.430
Cure Sunny!

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:37.190
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:40.190
Cure Peace!

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:45.870
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:48.900
Cure March!

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:55.040
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:57.900
Cure Beauty!

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:02.320
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:12.850
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:16.140
Bring it on!

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:18.840
Hyper!

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:22.410
Akanbe!

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:27.700
Hyper!

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:32.370
This is incredible!

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:33.670
Hy!

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:38.810
They're in trouble! Onii-chan, can't we use the Royal Clock to help them-kuru?!

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:40.910
We can't! Not yet-de gozaru...

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:47.150
It's as the Queen said: the Precure, as well as Candy, must unlock further power of their own-de gozaru!

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:49.320
Ooh, what a juicy tidbit.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:53.890
Kuru!

00:10:54.390 --> 00:11:00.190
Excellent! With this, our victory is more than assured!

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:02.700
Bravo, moi! Thank you, everyone, thank you!

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:07.480
The hell are you butting in for?!

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:10.110
Oh, don't mind me. Just lending a little hand.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:15.180
It wouldn't do if the Precure unlocked some incredible new power on us,

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:20.860
so I took the precaution of trapping that fairy of theirs in this Sloth Ball.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:22.690
Candy!

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:24.560
Give Candy back!

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.160
Oh, I think not.

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:33.270
Not when I know this little runt is one of the keys to unlocking the Royal Clock.

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:37.540
Wolfrun-san, I return the stage to your capable hands!

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:40.030
Let's enjoy the show!

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:42.990
Hmph! You scheme all you want!

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:46.750
As long as I get to beat the Precure down with my own two hands!

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.290
Everyone, let's go!

00:11:56.490 --> 00:11:57.720
Candy!

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:04.700
Candy!

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:09.900
Kuru...

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:12.360
Where am I-kuru...?

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.040
Candy!

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:21.710
Candy!

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:24.780
Candy, come play-maru!

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:25.950
This is fun-puru!

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:28.850
It's so wonderful here...

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:32.020
...you'll want to stay <i>forever-maru!</i>

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:34.390
Candy!

00:12:36.090 --> 00:12:37.290
Kuru!

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:41.100
My friends!

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:43.100
Are you alright, everyone?

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:46.070
Yeah... I ain't losin' to this chump!

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:48.590
We've gotta save Candy...

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:52.210
Save her? What delusions are you suffering from now?

00:12:53.180 --> 00:13:00.220
That rodent is too busy enjoying her sweet little dreams to care about you little brats.

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:01.980
What did you say?!

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:05.120
Kuru!

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:10.410
Let's play over here now-puru!

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:12.300
Come on-maru!

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:13.760
Kuru!

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:20.140
Inside this Sloth Ball is the very realization of the Bad End we hope for.

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:27.440
A place where you can forget all that burdens you, and eat and play forever without consequences.

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:36.320
Why on earth would anyone wish to return from such a paradise?

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:41.290
Candy will come back to us! I know it!

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:44.820
Maybe people would prefer to live like that...

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:48.860
At times we all wish we could run away from our problems...

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:54.770
But life just isn't as fun if you don't have to put any effort into it!

00:13:55.640 --> 00:14:00.210
Yeah... life ain't always as fun as ya might want it to be...

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:03.750
But I don't think that gives you a reason to just turn your back on it!

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:08.720
No matter how hard life gets, you have to press forward of your own volition!

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:12.050
For if you fail to do so, you shall never know true joy.

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:18.020
It's when you put your heart into something that you can really begin to enjoy it!

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:20.780
And Candy knows that, too!

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:24.560
She won't lose to your illusion!

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:27.620
My friends...

00:14:28.270 --> 00:14:30.330
Did you hear their voices-de gozaru, Candy?!

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:33.070
You have to snap out of it-de gozaru, Candy!

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:35.240
Candy!

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:36.910
Kuru?

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:38.800
What's the matter-puru?

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:41.740
I thought I just heard someone calling me-kuru...

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:43.520
You must be hearing things-puru!

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.450
Just stay and play with us forever-riru!

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:49.390
Life will be way more fun that way-maru!

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:51.150
Let's go play over there next-puru!

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:53.040
Come on, hurry up-riru!

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:53.600
Wait for me-kuru!

00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:59.600
Now, Wolfrun-san! Finish those Precure off for good!

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:03.480
Yeah, cause I totally need you spouting the obvious!

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:04.140
Hyper!

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:05.020
Together, now!

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:05.570
Okay!

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:12.510
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:21.850
Precure: Princess Form!

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:26.920
May the light of hope shine!

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:30.090
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:33.770
Precure...

00:15:33.770 --> 00:15:37.170
Rainbow...

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:40.290
Burst!

00:15:43.090 --> 00:15:45.550
That won't work on my black nose!

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:47.250
Hyper!

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:57.260
Candy...

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:02.800
All this playing's made me hungry again-kuru!

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:06.300
I know that smell!

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.810
It's the smell of sweets-kuru!

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:13.040
There's lots of yummy fruit here-puru!

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:15.280
And tons of sweets over here-riru!

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.980
This river's full of juice, too-maru!

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:20.280
It all looks so yummy-kuru!

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:21.950
Let's share it-kuru!

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:22.920
Why-puru?

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:26.590
Why share when there's so much all around-riru?

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:29.560
You can eat by yourself, Candy-maru!

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:32.290
By myself...?

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:47.050
That's right-kuru...

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:53.710
Happiness is better when you have someone to share it with...

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:56.050
<i>That's the secret to being ultra happy!</i>

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.220
What's wrong-puru?

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:04.140
Miyuki, Akane, Yayoi, Nao, Reika...

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:06.960
My friends are all waiting for me-kuru...

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:12.130
I've got to go back to them-kuru!

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:14.340
But life's so much fun here-maru!

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:18.310
You can forget all your troubles and worries, and just play all day-riru!

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:20.510
You'd be so much happier here-puru!

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:22.980
Candy!

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:28.080
Maybe I do have troubles and worries-kuru...

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:31.090
...but I... I want...

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:35.790
I want to be with my friends-kuru!

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.550
What?! That's impossible!

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:49.200
How did you escape from my illusion by yourself?!

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:51.970
I'm afraid you're already too late!

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:56.150
Your radiant future has already been clouded in darkness!

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:08.460
Everyone!

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:13.270
Welcome back... Candy...

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:19.970
I'm glad you're okay...

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:30.350
Miyuki!

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:32.560
Reika!

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:33.180
Yayoi!

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:34.790
Akane!

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:36.090
Nao!

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:37.790
Onii-chan!

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:47.030
Crying won't change anything, my dear.

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:59.140
I won't let you... I won't let you hurt my friends-kuru...

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:03.280
They mean everything to me-kuru...

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:08.550
And I want to be with them... be by their side forever-kuru!

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:13.820
You won't lay a finger on them-kuru!

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:14.520
The heck?!

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:29.180
Candy?!

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:31.440
This power...

00:19:31.970 --> 00:19:35.410
Is this what the Royal Queen was talking about?!

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:45.510
You little brat!

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:48.960
Hyper!

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:53.830
It turned back into a red nose?!

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:59.540
We heard you loud and clear, Candy...

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.180
Focus!

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:04.710
Focus, focus, focus, focus!

00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:08.340
Precure...

00:20:09.110 --> 00:20:11.350
Happy...

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:14.100
Shower!

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:19.070
Akanbe...

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:24.560
{TLC: of course, they didn't even have to explicitly explain that collecting all the decors means they have to collect another batch of decors...}

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:27.300
What's wrong with me...?

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:30.430
What did... that black nose do to my body...?

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.140
Candy.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.780
You've fought so hard.

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:44.110
Royal Queen-sama...

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:51.520
Your unyielding determination, your ever-present smile, the kindness you show to your friends...

00:20:51.820 --> 00:20:56.490
Make sure you carry these gifts forever in your heart.

00:21:01.430 --> 00:21:04.830
Candy! Candy, <i>Candy!</i>

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:07.840
Candy! Thank goodness!

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:09.790
Thank you, Candy!

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:11.310
I'm glad you're alright!

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:16.480
Candy.

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:19.680
I'm always here to help the Precure!

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:22.280
We're in this together!

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:26.160
So I always want to be here to fight with you-kuru!

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:29.820
Candy!

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:35.630
<i>Candy... I believe that you truly are Märchenland's...</i>

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:38.370
And they all live happily ever after... right?

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:41.640
Not this time, I'm afraid!

00:21:41.640 --> 00:21:42.580
Joker!

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:43.840
You still here?!

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:48.440
I believe it's time to give you a taste...

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:51.540
...of the splendors a Bad End can offer!

00:22:01.890 --> 00:22:03.290
Guys!

00:23:39.320 --> 00:23:41.340
I've gotta go and save them!

00:23:41.340 --> 00:23:46.910
Akane, Yayoi, Nao, and Reika... my beloved friends...

00:23:46.910 --> 00:23:50.140
Huh...? Did I have friends...?

00:23:50.140 --> 00:23:53.930
I kinda don't care anymore...

00:23:53.930 --> 00:23:56.830
Miyuki, no! You can't let yourself forget-kuru!

00:23:57.360 --> 00:23:58.820
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.570 --> 00:24:04.430
Find your ultra happy smile!
